# Port Assign Initiative

This app is bound to **port 4717** only. See `~/.cursor/PORT-ASSIGN-INITIATIVE.md` for the global policy.

- Run with `npm run dev` or `npm run start` — both use port **4717**.
- Never start this app on another port.
- Never start any other app on port **4717**.
